% A long corridor: the knocker walks four hops. One companion knows both pull and push
% but cannot do both jobs; the other only pushes.
linked(r0, r1). linked(r1, r0). linked(r1, r2). linked(r2, r1).
linked(r2, r3). linked(r3, r2). linked(r3, r4). linked(r4, r3).
linked(r4, rim). linked(rim, r4).
edge(rim, void).
companion(hero). companion(sage).
at(hero, r4). at(sage, r0).
knows(hero, whip). knows(hero, punch). knows(sage, blast).
skillKind(whip, pull). skillKind(punch, push). skillKind(blast, push).
at(beast, r4).
